      "[1. Natural Language Summary]:\n",
      "Udaplay is an AI research agent designed to answer complex questions about video games. Its core mechanics include querying a local vector database (ChromaDB) for game data, utilizing an OpenAI-compatible language model for understanding and generating responses, and employing a state machine for orchestrating tool calls, such as semantic search and web search. Recent updates focus on refining the interactions between the agent and the database, enhancing the agent's ability to retrieve and evaluate game-related information effectively.\n",
