      "    \"Integration with a local vector database (ChromaDB)\",\n",
      "    \"Use of an OpenAI-compatible language model for natural language processing\",\n",
      "    \"State machine for orchestrating tool calls like semantic and web search\"\n",
      "  ],\n",
      "  \"sources\": [\n",
      "    \"https://mcpmarket.com/server/udaplay\",\n",
